1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,120
Dadam telefonni faqat qo'ng'iroq qilish uchun ishlatardi.

2
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:05,650
Bir kuni aytdim:

3
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:09,770
«Dada, sun'iy intellektdan biror narsa so'rab ko'ring.»

4
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,820
U kulib qo'ydi:

5
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:14,380
«Men bunaqa narsalarga qarib qoldim.»

6
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:18,170
Men unga faqat bitta narsani o'rgatdim:

7
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:19,840
gapirib so'rashni.

8
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:22,620
Birinchi savoli:

9
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:25,250
«Pomidor bargi nega sarg'ayyapti?»

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,100
AI javob berdi.

11
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:31,810
Dadam ko'zoynagini taqib, diqqat bilan o'qidi.

12
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:35,670
Bir haftadan keyin o'zi qo'ng'iroq qildi:

13
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:39,260
«O'g'lim, AI'dan nevaramga ertak so'radim!»

14
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:42,950
Endi u har kuni yangi narsa o'rganadi.

15
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:46,010
Kecha esa menga o'zi dars berdi.

16
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:48,280
Texnologiya

17
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:50,000
yoshni so'ramaydi.

18
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:50,880
Faqat

19
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:52,780
birinchi qadamni kutadi.

20
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:54,700
Siz

21
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,040
ota-onangizga

22
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:58,450
nimani o'rgatgan bo'lardingiz?

